{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c01d729966be5de5b9a3170ce1f45ddf7c09660904aa568925565c68e1c82f7a","ja":"台本、できました！","zh":"剧本，完成了！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4ec19aeb2f134604892ddbe45e1f2815efd13ebd9c539ab603b0bed05c1adf4b","ja":"後日、みんなはまた映画の宣伝で\nTV局にやってきて……","zh":"后来，大家为了宣传电影\n再次来到了电视台……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b4fb1b1a7af14b25b90b71cabc85b586f756f47cde5b42a85ed22546367dd17e","ja":"みなさん、本番前にすみません。\nこれ、見てもらえませんか？","zh":"各位，在演出前打扰一下。\n这个，能请大家看一下吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"abf8a36c2345bfaa0015bcfa92fa608ef29716a334f57e778bdac3353a8a331a","ja":"えっ、なになに～？\nまた面白い本を見つけたの？","zh":"诶，怎么啦怎么啦～？\n又发现有趣的书了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9befe3f12816f95b2f90eb3e3816285c4e099b8cff030bfb1ef3d4558c2a70c9","ja":"これって……台本？　もしかして、\n映画の宣伝用に作ってきたの？","zh":"这个是……剧本？难道说，\n是专门为了宣传电影写的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"76246c21e1710492df228b7f7b174652afb3917ced6e07b96d78cd4e1da4b94c","ja":"はい！　今日の生放送のために\nお話しすることをまとめてきました！","zh":"好的！为了今天的直播，\n我已经把要讲的事情整理好带过来了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ca8badd56fe1108cf92b776f03f4f8da1c7f895c09f5edcf576acf97e8ab8fd9","ja":"なるほど……。うん、映画の内容をよく\n説明できてると思うわよ。ただ、これだと……。","zh":"原来如此……。嗯，我觉得把电影的内容\n解释得很清楚哦。不过，这样的话……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"38cb5ca78396db2e0cfac014bd2c78a32e82cccbd778bacb32962be1c7285b33","ja":"説明しすぎですよね。\nネタバレになりそうな部分にも触れてますし……。","zh":"说明得有点过头了呢。\n而且还提到了可能会剧透的部分……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"fdd44eb52ce0f917bbb21b0c0a0cbf7ef3f95686a2575f1d5b196fcae6bbcfd7","ja":"それにやっぱり、まだ長いんじゃないかと。","zh":"而且我觉得，果然还是有点长。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"547e5d6f28e36eeb2115751939270b0edfb10825b01508b022da2bcb18bd5d66","ja":"そうだね。みんなのセリフまで考えてくれてるけど、\nこれだと時間内に収まりきらないかも。","zh":"说的也是呢。虽然连大家的台词都考虑到了，\n但这样一来，在规定时间内可能会来不及。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"9b26fdf10b67016832702b87041897ac068deccf24ae906f490c7b3a3ef2ecb4","ja":"やっぱりそうなんですね……。\nなんとなくそう感じてはいたんですけど……。","zh":"果然是这样啊……。\n虽然我也隐约有这种感觉……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"6cb4404ba0d628c617e3c96f4676c0a9147b7959265f373765dc0998ecbab747","ja":"で、でも、まだ本番まで時間はありますよね？\nそれまでに削れるところを探して……。","zh":"但、但是，到正式演出前还有时间对吧？\n在那之前找找能削减的地方……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"ab0bad2188ffcea996f22d5ee3da28eeb5dff2bc09a61a8b254273219f44c410","ja":"ねえ、百合子。映画の内容って\nそんなに話さなくいいんじゃないかな？","zh":"我说，百合子。电影的内容\n是不是不用讲那么多比较好呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"d9845769252ab69dda266f1b877357f980868b78ccbea10f7ac257b351ae3729","ja":"百合子が一番おススメしたいポイントを\n言うだけで良いと思うよ。","zh":"只要说出百合子最想推荐的看点\n我觉得就行了哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1357.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"19ef0e7c882375a8a7c49c6c221767f335432ea72d46e51dca17f1cd82f73cae","ja":"ええっ！　で、でも、それだけだと、\n映画の魅力が伝わりきらないんじゃ……！？","zh":"诶诶！可、可是，光凭那样的话，\n电影的魅力不就无法完全传达出来了吗……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
